Kode Mono 2.003. Family name in the Font list: "Kode Mono".

Unmodified copy of the upstream variable font (the weight axis covers regular
and bold; the width and roundness axes stay at their defaults). Kode Mono has
no italic design: italic text uses the regular face.

- `KodeMono[ROND,wdth,wght].ttf`: `fonts/variable/` of the GitHub release
  v2.003, https://github.com/isaozler/kode-mono/releases/tag/v2.003
  (kode-mono-v2.003.zip, sha256
  dd8e64e226aed1ea8b78651e378a0fd9549cd34ce61c0574e4f150a218e903d9)
  sha256 b6404c5ace111fb7665eaae6b3994596b6eccf8f85f9312780cca2721b90ce22.
- `OFL.txt`: SIL Open Font License 1.1, `OFL.txt` of the same archive.
